{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc38 A Cozy Frog Collector \u2014 With No Pressure Attached</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Frog Pond Simulator</strong>, a cozy and relaxing experience that lets you enjoy the peace of a small pond that slowly fills with new frogs as the time goes by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every frog is unique looking and some of them also have some... unusual behavior.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to Expect:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>No Goals, No Rush</strong> \u2014 It\u2019s all about relaxing and watching your pond come to life.<br>\u2705 <strong>Frogs with Personality</strong> \u2014 Each frog brings a bit of weirdness and whimsy to your collection.<br>\u2705 <strong>Cozy, Calming Vibes</strong> \u2014 Perfect for background play or when you need to unwind.<br>\u2705 <strong>Secrets to Discover</strong> \u2014 Who knows what surprises might float your way?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/extras/86b60c07d2485968b62ec8fa451d1b6e.avif?t=1754064549\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you check in every few minutes or leave it running while you work, this pond is here to make your day a little<strong> lighter, </strong>a little <strong>sillier, </strong>and a lot more <strong><i>frog-filled</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you love chill games with a touch of oddball charm\u2026 you\u2019ll feel right at home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892380?t=1754064549","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3892380?t=1754064549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892380/becdcab8fa74fc5e0eb6f5128bfe580c1cf1c9f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?